@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+Stock photos from Unsplash, downloaded as cropped WebP images at responsive sizes:
+
+- Hero: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085
+- Latte and seasonal promo: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570968915860-54d5c301fa9f
+- Espresso: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510707577719-ae7c14805e3a
+- Cold brew: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517701604599-bb29b565090c
+
+Downloads use `fm=webp&fit=crop&q=75` with the width in each filename. Hero
+images use a 16:9 crop; product images use a 4:3 crop. The promo reuses the
+latte assets so the browser can share its cache with the seasonal card.
